OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy in the west with showers easing
OL,7,Fin the evening, dry overnight, before
OL,8,Fshowers return towards dawn. Dry in
OL,9,Fthe east with clear spells. Less cold
OL,10,Fthan the previous night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSome sunny spells earlier in
OL,13,Fthe morning before turning cloudier
OL,14,Fwith showers over Dumfries and
OL,15,FBorders. Cloudy in the afternoon with
OL,16,Fshowers continuing and spreading north
OL,17,Finto Lothian.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
